      "body": "Hey,\nThe only logs  we can get is :\n```\nhomarr  | 2025-06-26T12:36:36.047Z info: user qsdqsd was not found\nhomarr  | 2025-06-26T12:36:36.048Z error: Read more at https://errors.authjs.dev#credentialssignin name=\"l\" type=\"CredentialsSignin\" kind=\"signIn\" code=\"credentials\"\nhomarr  |     at ih (/app/apps/nextjs/.next/server/chunks/2989.js:411:17390)\nhomarr  |     at async iy (/app/apps/nextjs/.next/server/chunks/2989.js:411:26869)\nhomarr  |     at async ib (/app/apps/nextjs/.next/server/chunks/2989.js:411:31170)\nhomarr  |     at async d (/app/apps/nextjs/.next/server/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.js:1:2815)\nhomarr  |     at async tf.do (/app/node_modules/next/dist/compiled/next-server/app-route.runtime.prod.js:18:18835)\nhomarr  |     at async tf.handle (/app/node_modules/next/dist/compiled/next-server/app-route.runtime.prod.js:18:23727)\nhomarr  |     at async doRender (/app/node_modules/next/dist/server/base-server.js:1518:42)\nhomarr  |     at async NextNodeServer.renderToResponseWithComponentsImpl (/app/node_modules/next/dist/server/base-server.js:1920:28)\nhomarr  |     at async NextNodeServer.renderPageComponent (/app/node_modules/next/dist/server/base-server.js:2408:24)\nhomarr  |     at async NextNodeServer.renderToResponseImpl (/app/node_modules/next/dist/server/base-server.js:2445:32)\n```\nIndeed, having the source IP would be the least we could do to at least avoid brute force...\nBe careful to follow the `X-Forwarded-For` header.\nThanks !",
